        "\\section{Methodology}\n",
        "We design GradTS based on the hypothesis that better auxiliary tasks share more important linguistic features with the primary task.\n",
        "Since each attention head in a Transformer-based model functions similarly as a standalone feature extractor on a specialized set of features, we approximate the important feature set of each task by the heads contributing the most to the task.\n",
